  "releaseNotes": "SubscriptionHolder: fan-out fallback + multi-owner order TxId for Transactions\nMessages: IClientCodeMessage and IBrokerCodeMessage interfaces\nSubscriptionReplayTracker: preserve txIds across internal reconnect\nStopOrder: percent-based activation, limit and trailing offset\nSubscriptionReplayTracker: drain on replay + drop channel parameter\nDataType: guard ToString against null MessageType\nSnapshotHolders: strip subscription IDs from TryGetSnapshot clones\nRemove IBinaryAdapter interface and IsBinaryEnabled from RemoteMarketDataDrive\nAdd SubscriptionReplayTracker for connector reconnection subscription replay\nAdd PositionSnapshotHolder.GetAllSnapshots() with tests\nFix PositionSnapshotHolder returning live reference instead of copy",
